{#
  FAQ block (tatami/faq) — one question and its answer as a native
  disclosure, rendered by Tatami\Faqs::render(). Nothing renders without
  both a question and an answer.

  The base adds no classes; a site styles the FAQ here, with utilities.

  question  plain text
  answer    the block's rendered Paragraph and List blocks (HTML)
#}
<details>
  <summary>
    {{ question }}
  </summary>
  <div>
    {{ answer|raw }}
  </div>
</details>
